  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a1b8d061-bf40-4cbb-ab58-d352389a816c-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 210px;\" /></p><p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>, are parametric points on parabola<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br />Slope of normal at <math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Since normal passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math><mo>&rArr;</mo></math>&nbsp; slope of normal at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;= slope of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&rArr;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&ge;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&ge;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>,</p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AM</mi><mo>&ge;</mo><mi>GM</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&there4;</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&ge;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>from</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&ge;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&there4;</mo></math> &nbsp; Minimum value<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>",
